  <Seers.label>秘能信徒</Seers.label>
  <!--原中文: '这个一个鲜为人知的教派。他们掌握着某些神秘的技术但又不依赖于它. 信徒们会使用简单的工具和火器.\n  他们在生存问题面前会选择与其他派系合作，但没有人知道他们到底在追求着什么.\n  据小道消息， 他们拥有关于制造和使用具有神秘力量的人工制品的能力。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Little is known about this secretive faction.  They possess some technology, but do not seem to dependent on it. They work simple tools and defend themselves with firearms.\n\nThey participate in the the practical matters of trade, trust, and survival, but their primary interest is unclear.\n\nAccording to traveler tales and information gathered from other factions, they have knowledge, and use, of mysterious powers and artifacts.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Little is known about this secretive faction.  They possess some technology, but do not seem to dependent on it. They work simple tools and defend themselves with firearms.\n\nThey participate in the the practical matters of trade, trust, and survival, but their primary interest is unclear.\n\nAccording to traveler tales and information gathered from other factions, they have knowledge, and use, of mysterious powers and artifacts.-->
  <Seers.description>这个一个鲜为人知的教派。他们掌握着某些神秘的技术但又不依赖于它. 信徒们会使用简单的工具和火器.\n  他们在生存问题面前会选择与其他派系合作，但没有人知道他们到底在追求着什么.\n  据小道消息， 他们拥有关于制造和使用具有神秘力量的人工制品的能力。</Seers.description>
